  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a3146523-d07e-5cc3-9392-7663896416c0" activityNameId="df838d20-b689-5e1f-8872-b7a7cf95fde7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">OLED module, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: OLED module, at plant
Data are based on information in an LCA study about OLED matrices for device screens; UUID: 5e8cee0e-ec8e-353d-9454-dac242cf0704
The source of life cycle inventory for organic light emitting diode (OLED) is the LCA study of Amasawa et al., 2016. Overall, the approaches for constructing inventories of fine specialty chemicals and fabrication process in the OLED for smartphones or other smart devices involve creation of inventory with stoichiometry and application of observed correlation between display area and production cost in the display industry. From this study, four specialty chemicals/ingredients are chosen for organic and metal layer depositions, namely bisphenol-A, phtalic anhydride, magnesium, and silver. The geographical specificity is set to be in South Korea, because the majority of active matrix OLED display productions (&gt;90% of production share) occur in the country according to Semenza, 2013. For such reason, all electricity input reflects the electricity mix of South Korean grid.
Location: Data from literature – used as data for the global composition average
Technology: OLED module manufactured using specialty chemicals.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5e8cee0e-ec8e-353d-9454-dac242cf0704.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
